<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Wind Slash</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 10)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast wind slash &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast wind slash</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster sweeps a hand toward the target, and a massive, focused blast 
of wind slashes at them. The better your divine power and your summoning 
sphere, the more it hurts. The wind cares little what armour the target 
wears, but a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting, and no free hands are needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Thorn Strike</a>
